<span class="label">7.</span><cite>Shukla AK, Xiao K, Lefkowitz RJ. Emerging paradigms of β-arrestin-dependent seven transmembrane receptor signaling. Trends Biochem Sci. 2011;36(9):457–469. doi: 10.1016/j.tibs.2011.06.003.</cite> [<a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tibs.2011.06.003" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DOI</a>] [<a href="/articles/PMC3168679/" class="usa-link">PMC free article</a>] [<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21764321/" class="usa-link">PubMed</a>] [<a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Trends%20Biochem%20Sci&amp;title=Emerging%20paradigms%20of%20%CE%B2-arrestin-dependent%20seven%20transmembrane%20receptor%20signaling&amp;author=AK%20Shukla&amp;author=K%20Xiao&amp;author=RJ%20Lefkowitz&amp;volume=36&amp;issue=9&amp;publication_year=2011&amp;pages=457-469&amp;pmid=21764321&amp;doi=10.1016/j.tibs.2011.06.003&amp;" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a>]</li>
